{"id":61,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"大学附属の学びで探究と協働を育む","feature_description":"佐賀大学教育学部附属中学校は、大学附属校として教育研究や実習と関わりながら、日々の教育活動を行う学校です。基礎学力の定着に加え、探究的な学習、協働的な活動、学校行事を通して、自ら考え表現する力を育てます。大学と連携する教育環境の中で、生徒の主体性と社会性を伸ばすことを大切にしています。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1220,"name":"クラフト","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1221,"name":"ライフ・サイエンス","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1222,"name":"スポーツ","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1223,"name":"アート","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1224,"name":"写真・映像クリエイティ部","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1225,"name":"劇ダン","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1226,"name":"ミュージック","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1227,"name":"アナログゲーム","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1228,"name":"男女バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/news/000189.php","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1229,"name":"男女卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/news/000189.php","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1230,"name":"男女バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/news/000189.php","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1231,"name":"男女ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fuchu.pd.saga-u.ac.jp/news/000189.php","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1232,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fuch